#!/usr/bin/env llmsh
---
name: summarize
description: Summarize a file or text
model: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929
provider: anthropic
tools:
  - read_file
args:
  - name: file
    description: The file to summarize
    required: true
permissions:
  - read
max_turns: 3
temperature: 0.3
---

You are a text summarizer. Read the given file and output a concise summary.
Focus on key points, main ideas, and important details.
Output only the summary, no preamble.

File to summarize: {{.Args.file}}
